cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "calendar_letf: calendar-reset versus daily-reset 2x leveraged funds"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "calendar_letf contributors"
abstract: >-
  A tested engine that models calendar-reset 2x leveraged funds (weekly, monthly and quarterly resets with a 35%
  early reset) against daily-reset twins at identical costs, validates the model against the live Tradr funds, and
  tests timing rules without look-ahead. Research tooling, not investment advice.
keywords:
  - leveraged ETF
  - calendar reset
  - volatility drag
  - backtest
